WEBVTT

00:11.200 --> 00:12.740
This is my path...

00:15.960 --> 00:17.500
This is my story...

00:19.740 --> 00:21.250
...to becoming
the Supreme Commander.

00:21.840 --> 00:25.000
...of becoming a Hero!

00:26.120 --> 00:29.760
When I gently wake up

00:31.080 --> 00:35.180
I find myself covered in darkness

00:35.900 --> 00:43.560
As tears fall one by one,
I endure my own grief

00:43.560 --> 00:46.440
I vowed to hold that hope in my hands

01:00.440 --> 01:03.580
I've been dreaming of it for a long time

01:05.927 --> 01:09.460
A dream that feels
so distant and unreachable

01:10.240 --> 01:14.630
I kept hoping that it would come true

01:15.400 --> 01:20.010
That's when you reached out to me

01:20.010 --> 01:22.430
"You are always looking forward."

01:22.430 --> 01:25.400
"You are always genuine."

01:25.400 --> 01:29.700
I know I can make it with you

01:29.700 --> 01:35.180
I'll turn this world
into a garden of light

01:35.180 --> 01:40.320
I'll do it for sure,
and lead it to the future

01:57.100 --> 01:59.970
By the way, isn't that Mato peach?

02:00.440 --> 02:01.260
It is.

02:01.500 --> 02:04.100
You didn't eat it back then, right?

02:04.100 --> 02:08.160
(EPISODE.10 Battle Begins, Naon Sings)
It needs a lot of procedures
and all that.

02:08.160 --> 02:10.145
There are some who don't eat peaches.

02:11.280 --> 02:12.300
I see.

02:12.300 --> 02:16.820
So your power came
from the peach, then?

02:18.000 --> 02:20.020
Of course it's not
completely unrelated.

02:22.460 --> 02:25.940
If anything, it's what made us
into what we are right now.

02:27.580 --> 02:29.520
Please tell me more about that!

02:29.820 --> 02:33.210
I'd better I'm the one who tells him.

02:37.560 --> 02:40.640
Are you sure?
It's a painful memory for you, right?

02:40.640 --> 02:41.970
He should know.

02:42.900 --> 02:47.810
Besides, I can explain it
more clearly and beautifully.

02:48.560 --> 02:50.020
Naon...

02:50.380 --> 02:53.740
At that time, I was working in our world.

02:53.740 --> 02:57.320
As you probably guessed, I was a model.

02:57.320 --> 02:58.620
Of course...

02:59.420 --> 03:04.040
But one day,
I was caught in a Mato Mishap.

03:04.370 --> 03:06.780
I hadn't eaten a peach that time.

03:07.260 --> 03:15.660
I thought I'd rejuvenate if I ate one after
growing old because I longed for beauty.

03:17.160 --> 03:21.160
But I couldn't even afford
to think about that.

03:28.120 --> 03:32.320
And then, the power of the peach
went out of control.

03:38.420 --> 03:42.410
The next thing I knew,
I was brought into a dark room.

03:42.920 --> 03:47.040
A creepy old woman was staring at me.

03:47.500 --> 03:50.760
She told me when I was still confused.

03:51.000 --> 03:56.470
I was in the Yin Yang Dorm,
a research facility to study Shuuki.

03:56.700 --> 04:00.180
I couldn't get the rest of
her words into my head.

04:00.960 --> 04:05.790
A place to study Shuuki?
Why would I be in such a place?

04:06.860 --> 04:08.010
No!

04:09.150 --> 04:11.620
My beautiful body!

04:11.620 --> 04:14.940
This kind of accident
doesn't happen in our world.

04:15.520 --> 04:19.740
Our leading theory is it was caused
by the miasma of Mato,

04:19.740 --> 04:23.200
but we need to do more research.

04:24.760 --> 04:25.700
No!

04:25.700 --> 04:34.000
As a precious specimen, we ask that
you cooperate with us in our research.

04:35.420 --> 04:36.710
Research?

04:40.660 --> 04:45.390
No! Cure me!
Turn me back into the beauty I was!

04:45.540 --> 04:49.850
If the research advances, we should
be able to find a way to cure you.

04:50.760 --> 04:59.020
Until then, please cooperate with us
for the good of humanity.

05:00.240 --> 05:05.840
They examined me all over my body
and used me as their guinea pig.

05:09.460 --> 05:10.890
No way.

05:11.060 --> 05:12.880
But a blessing hiding
within that misfortune.

05:13.780 --> 05:17.580
I awakened the ability
to pass through objects.

05:17.580 --> 05:20.960
I found an opportunity
and then escaped with my friends.

05:22.740 --> 05:27.780
Some of us escaped in other ways,
but their stories are the same.

05:27.780 --> 05:30.560
When I saw her wounds, I snapped.

05:31.440 --> 05:33.120
Then you too?

05:33.120 --> 05:36.480
Up until the part where the peach I ate
went out of control.

05:36.780 --> 05:40.340
In my case, the symptoms were worse.

05:40.840 --> 05:47.490
I found this place and fought to keep
my senses as a human here for years.

05:47.960 --> 05:51.880
When I finally got to my senses,
I met them.

05:51.880 --> 05:53.540
It must have been hard.

05:53.800 --> 05:57.920
Now you see why I was
so cautious to rescue you.

05:58.080 --> 06:00.120
Mato's darkness really runs deep.

06:00.560 --> 06:04.340
We should tell everyone about this.

06:04.340 --> 06:05.360
It's useless.

06:05.640 --> 06:11.340
The Yin Yang Dorm is an organization that
believes Mato is beneficial for the nation.

06:11.640 --> 06:15.510
They have the power to shut
the attempt down.

06:16.160 --> 06:21.400
One of the proof is, you don't know
about this until we met, right?

06:22.960 --> 06:25.930
And that's why,
we'll force our way through!

06:25.930 --> 06:29.180
We're gonna storm the Yin Yang Dorm
and destroy them!

06:29.180 --> 06:32.580
Then, save the comrades who are
going through the same thing!

06:32.580 --> 06:33.910
Isn't that right, you guys!?

06:37.740 --> 06:39.000
This is Kuma-douji.

06:39.000 --> 06:40.840
(Kuma-douji)

06:41.440 --> 06:42.420
Akura.

06:42.420 --> 06:44.010
(Akura)

06:50.800 --> 06:51.890
The Unihorn...

06:52.260 --> 06:54.940
I call this one Kidomaru.

06:55.190 --> 06:56.900
(Kidomaru)

06:57.160 --> 07:01.400
These three are stronger
than normal Shuukis.

07:01.400 --> 07:03.720
It took a lot of work
to tame them, though.

07:05.200 --> 07:08.220
We understand each other
by exchanging punches.

07:08.220 --> 07:10.160
Isn't that right, Kuma?

07:10.420 --> 07:12.740
Our forces are ready.

07:13.160 --> 07:15.660
We've established our attack routes,

07:16.280 --> 07:18.580
and we're ready to attack at any moment.

07:18.580 --> 07:21.720
Wait!
I can understand your action.

07:21.720 --> 07:24.670
But there will be a lot of victims.

07:24.840 --> 07:28.920
If the Demon Defense Force knows,
there's no way they stay quiet.

07:29.200 --> 07:30.880
If we can get their help...

07:31.200 --> 07:37.000
You think their Supreme Commander
didn't know about Yin Yang Dorm?

07:37.180 --> 07:41.140
Any place that makes us cry for
the sake of the nation is the enemy!

07:41.140 --> 07:42.770
We can't trust any of them!

07:42.770 --> 07:45.020
But, if it's Miss Kyouka and others...

07:45.020 --> 07:46.070
Don't worry.

07:46.200 --> 07:50.530
We're going to find a way
to cure our bodies on our own.

07:55.280 --> 07:58.440
Tell everyone to move just like planned.

07:58.440 --> 07:59.290
Got it!

07:59.480 --> 08:01.080
What's wrong?

08:01.420 --> 08:03.200
It's a prelude.

08:08.580 --> 08:11.300
We've come a long way, haven't we?

08:11.300 --> 08:13.600
Yukki, where are you?

08:14.300 --> 08:15.390
This way.

08:16.980 --> 08:20.940
We've moved around using Ame-no-Mitori
many times up to this point.

08:20.940 --> 08:23.470
Commander, where's Yuuki?

08:25.080 --> 08:29.960
It seems my feet are heading
towards those boulders.

08:32.240 --> 08:33.418
A cave, huh?

08:33.418 --> 08:35.418
So they concealed the entrance.

08:35.418 --> 08:35.582
So they concealed the entrance.
The humanoid Shuukis that kidnapped
Yuuki are probably dwelling inside.

08:35.582 --> 08:40.418
The humanoid Shuukis that kidnapped
Yuuki are probably dwelling inside.

08:40.418 --> 08:42.150
Let's get in, Tenka!

08:42.150 --> 08:45.170
Today's the first time I realized...

08:46.040 --> 08:50.300
What it feels like to have
your lover stolen from you.

08:51.600 --> 08:55.780
As soon as Syusyu manages to break
the entrance, go inside immediately.

08:55.780 --> 08:58.580
Our priority is to rescue Yuuki.

08:58.580 --> 09:00.800
Avoid combat if possible.

09:01.280 --> 09:03.560
What if we're intercepted by a humanoid?

09:03.560 --> 09:06.360
We will seek a dialogue following
the Supreme Commander's order.

09:06.600 --> 09:09.100
If they don't comply,
you're allowed to engage in combat.

09:10.100 --> 09:12.660
Okay, let's go then.

09:15.500 --> 09:16.700
An ambush?

09:16.700 --> 09:17.670
Leave it to me!

09:17.670 --> 09:19.960
Golden Hour!
Stop time for five seconds!

09:19.960 --> 09:21.710
(Golden Hour)

09:26.140 --> 09:26.880
Huh?

09:26.880 --> 09:29.920
It's a waste of time to deal
with small fries.

09:29.920 --> 09:32.630
We should prioritize his rescue,
let's get into the cave.

09:32.780 --> 09:34.730
Amazing! I'm not gonna lose.

09:34.730 --> 09:37.560
Kuma Tackle!

09:42.180 --> 09:45.460
I am here!

09:45.460 --> 09:47.060
So you guys are my prey?

09:47.060 --> 09:48.780
The entrance opened!

09:49.060 --> 09:50.610
Go, Kuma!

09:53.060 --> 09:53.700
Sahara!

10:00.980 --> 10:02.600
Leave them to us!

10:02.600 --> 10:03.710
Thanks!

10:04.720 --> 10:06.790
I won't let them get
in the Commander's way!

10:09.380 --> 10:11.090
Damn you!

10:12.420 --> 10:14.680
So this is a cave in Mato.

10:14.820 --> 10:19.390
This is nothing like the central caverns
our away teams are exploring.

10:19.600 --> 10:22.340
It's more cramped and
there aren't any peaches here.

10:22.540 --> 10:27.110
The distance might be as far as I can see,
but shall we teleport deeper?

10:28.220 --> 10:28.820
Hold on!

10:32.500 --> 10:34.740
Shuuki holding weapons...

10:34.980 --> 10:36.080
Let's do it.

10:36.080 --> 10:38.420
Slave Boy is up ahead, right?

10:39.020 --> 10:40.010
Looks like it.

10:41.040 --> 10:42.780
We should prioritize his rescue.

10:42.780 --> 10:44.290
Commanders, please go on ahead.

10:45.020 --> 10:45.870
We'll leave them to you.

10:46.880 --> 10:48.760
We'll be right back to pick you up.

10:51.000 --> 10:53.140
This is the sisters' joint fight.

10:53.140 --> 10:56.140
It must be very reassuring to you, Himari.

10:56.140 --> 10:57.340
Yeah, right.

10:58.220 --> 11:00.760
We Azuma will defeat the enemies here.

11:00.860 --> 11:04.280
Let's defeat them so they can't get in
our Commanders' way.

11:12.760 --> 11:14.340
You stay here, Yuuki.

11:14.340 --> 11:15.440
Big Sis...

11:19.560 --> 11:20.910
Miss Kyouka!

11:21.060 --> 11:23.220
You have come this far already.

11:23.220 --> 11:25.450
Your other friends must be
fighting Coco and others.

11:39.540 --> 11:40.850
Teleportation...

11:43.770 --> 11:47.860
I've figured out that ability.

11:48.940 --> 11:51.400
I think we'll be fine here for a while.

11:52.160 --> 11:54.100
Are you okay, Slave Boy?

11:54.400 --> 11:55.860
Did they do anything to you?

11:55.860 --> 11:58.610
I'm fine. How do you
figure out this place?

11:59.540 --> 12:02.020
I won't be able to move freely
until we get this over with.

12:02.380 --> 12:03.300
Let's do it.

12:03.300 --> 12:04.040
Huh?

12:09.740 --> 12:14.300
I see. She knew my position
because of the price of her ability.

12:20.820 --> 12:21.900
Miss Tenka?!

12:26.320 --> 12:28.040
Why are you doing it too?

12:28.040 --> 12:31.460
It's a reward for the hard work he did.

12:31.620 --> 12:33.060
Good grief.

12:33.750 --> 12:35.320
Don't move.

12:35.900 --> 12:39.400
Let's get it over quickly and regroup
with Himari and the others.

12:39.640 --> 12:44.120
We'll pick them all up and
head back to the dorm immediately.

12:44.220 --> 12:47.750
So Himari and the others came too?

12:47.750 --> 12:48.960
More importantly...

12:51.420 --> 12:54.130
How long is this going to go on?

12:59.150 --> 13:00.720
Found you.

13:00.920 --> 13:02.770
Kyochin, what about your body?

13:02.770 --> 13:03.510
I can move.

13:05.680 --> 13:06.430
Stop!

13:11.260 --> 13:12.540
Yuuki?

13:12.540 --> 13:14.080
She is my sister.

13:14.080 --> 13:15.320
Your sister?!

13:15.540 --> 13:17.820
Yuuki, out of my way!

13:17.820 --> 13:19.940
Listen to me, Big Sis!

13:20.400 --> 13:21.760
Please!

13:30.240 --> 13:34.350
I've always been weak
to your desperate pleas.

13:35.180 --> 13:36.980
Her killing intent has gone.

13:37.460 --> 13:40.470
Is she really his sister?

13:40.580 --> 13:42.400
Please listen to me.

13:42.400 --> 13:46.360
I'm going to explain
what happened to my sister.

13:51.880 --> 13:53.620
Make it short.

14:00.500 --> 14:01.490
Alright!

14:01.600 --> 14:06.200
Next, I'll prepare the futon, so that
everyone can rest as soon as they return.

14:06.580 --> 14:08.570
Need to clean the bathroom too.

14:09.460 --> 14:11.100
And then...

14:18.200 --> 14:21.840
I have to take care of the dormitory
until Yuuki comes back.

14:22.240 --> 14:24.510
Coco Uppercut!

14:26.620 --> 14:27.740
Sahara!

14:33.240 --> 14:36.100
You've been running away
for a while! It's boring!

14:36.100 --> 14:37.540
Are you going to fight or not?

14:37.840 --> 14:41.180
We're going to ask you one more time.
Are you willing to have a talk?

14:41.360 --> 14:42.660
No.

14:42.660 --> 14:44.400
It's to defeat or to be defeated here.

14:44.560 --> 14:47.770
I see, then we don't have a choice.

14:52.950 --> 14:54.920
Paradigm Shift!

14:58.060 --> 15:01.040
Mad Sheep!

15:02.210 --> 15:03.090
Two!

15:04.580 --> 15:06.640
You two are finally up for it.

15:06.820 --> 15:09.040
Now, it's a contest!

15:18.800 --> 15:20.210
Found it.

15:24.300 --> 15:25.900
There's no end of them.

15:34.280 --> 15:37.820
Not even looking at them.
What did she do?

15:38.320 --> 15:42.280
Himari, you may have shown off
in the Intersquad Tournament,

15:42.280 --> 15:43.680
but you're still a novice.

15:43.680 --> 15:46.740
Take it easy and follow
this glorious sister of yours.

15:46.740 --> 15:50.640
Do that, and I'll protect you
as your older sister.

15:50.640 --> 15:51.930
Yeah, yeah.

15:54.020 --> 15:57.000
The enemy is only in front of us!
Make them a beehive!

15:59.960 --> 16:02.520
Tch. That guy is clever.

16:02.620 --> 16:04.990
As long as I don't know her ability,

16:05.140 --> 16:08.320
making a rash move
won't be beautiful.

16:08.700 --> 16:10.220
Then, my target should be...

16:12.420 --> 16:13.820
The Yin Yang Dorm.

16:14.220 --> 16:15.900
Peaches going out of control.

16:16.560 --> 16:18.620
And its research.

16:19.060 --> 16:21.740
I knew they studied Shuuki,

16:21.740 --> 16:24.660
but I didn't know they were doing
this kind of thing in the back.

16:24.660 --> 16:28.180
If what you say is true,
I'll crush the Yin Yang Dorm.

16:28.180 --> 16:29.050
Trust me.

16:29.050 --> 16:31.460
We'll act as we want.

16:31.460 --> 16:33.640
We're going to defeat those
who get in our way.

16:33.780 --> 16:37.520
You mean you won't change your mind
about using Shuuki to cause a revolt?

16:37.520 --> 16:41.500
Trusting two of the main cogs of
the organization doesn't make any sense.

16:41.500 --> 16:43.610
There will be a lot of victims.

16:43.760 --> 16:45.560
We are also a victim.

16:49.600 --> 16:52.760
Big Sis, you can trust Miss Kyouka.

16:52.760 --> 16:54.240
She is my superior.

16:54.500 --> 16:57.540
But she's treating you as a slave.

16:57.540 --> 16:59.460
She even put that chain on you.

16:59.460 --> 17:00.730
About that...

17:01.460 --> 17:03.260
It's something I decided on my own.

17:03.720 --> 17:07.164
I became her slave to be a hero.

17:09.836 --> 17:11.164
If it's for my friends...

17:13.300 --> 17:15.770
Then we will use force to stop you.

17:15.770 --> 17:16.836
Miss Kyouka!

17:17.040 --> 17:19.040
Sorry, Yuuki.

17:19.836 --> 17:22.020
This is what everyone in
the Demon Defense Force would do.

17:22.642 --> 17:23.450
Wait, no...

17:27.540 --> 17:28.990
Big Sis!

17:35.940 --> 17:39.700
The battle's about to begin.
You should stay there.

17:40.580 --> 17:42.820
What a kind older sister.

17:43.060 --> 17:45.660
Yuuki can't fight her.

17:45.660 --> 17:47.920
It'd be safer for him to stay away.

17:48.060 --> 17:50.710
Alright, let's do this.

17:59.520 --> 18:00.940
Unihorn!

18:00.940 --> 18:02.420
I leave that to you.

18:07.480 --> 18:08.900
Naturally.

18:12.800 --> 18:16.180
So you're my opponent?
Who are you again?

18:16.700 --> 18:19.120
Right, I forgot to introduce myself.

18:19.320 --> 18:20.500
Hello, sister-in-law.

18:20.660 --> 18:23.760
I'm Tenka Izumo,
the Commander of the 6th Squad,

18:23.760 --> 18:26.840
and currently going out with Yuuki.

18:31.560 --> 18:33.130
Drop dead!

18:33.580 --> 18:35.180
I can't stop them.

18:35.180 --> 18:37.060
Damn it!

18:40.240 --> 18:41.900
Coco Wild Dance!

18:42.180 --> 18:44.350
Fast and heavy!

18:44.350 --> 18:46.060
Come on!

18:47.060 --> 18:48.280
But...

18:49.720 --> 18:51.190
Her attacks are messy.

18:51.800 --> 18:53.220
There it is, a large swing!

18:53.220 --> 18:55.490
Now is my chance to strike!

19:04.560 --> 19:05.400
Kuma!

19:15.780 --> 19:18.380
I'll crush you to bits.

19:21.580 --> 19:22.890
So tough.

19:22.890 --> 19:26.520
Hard to believe you're this tough.
In that case...

19:26.520 --> 19:28.350
Take this!

19:28.700 --> 19:30.230
Then...

19:30.900 --> 19:32.820
Boom!

19:39.660 --> 19:41.330
It doesn't have a single scratch on it.

19:42.420 --> 19:43.800
It's no use.

19:43.800 --> 19:47.120
Kuma's tough, and I'm all slippery.

19:47.320 --> 19:49.130
Your attacks won't work on us.

19:50.820 --> 19:55.240
For you girls, Kuma and I are
your worst opponent!

19:58.120 --> 19:59.090
This is bad.

20:00.640 --> 20:02.180
Leave the rest to me!

20:02.180 --> 20:03.840
Golden Hour!

20:04.140 --> 20:05.180
(Golden Hour)

20:05.180 --> 20:06.650
Stop time for five seconds!

20:09.500 --> 20:11.560
Nice spearhandling.

20:11.720 --> 20:13.020
But it's over.

20:32.920 --> 20:34.880
It made a last-ditch effort.

20:46.100 --> 20:48.390
Himari!

20:56.060 --> 20:57.080
Shikoku.

20:58.580 --> 21:00.490
I found what you're looking for.

21:01.080 --> 21:03.450
Oh, finally.

21:05.060 --> 21:07.110
I'm surprised you could find it.

21:07.900 --> 21:10.460
Looks like they're in battle
with the Demon Defense Force.

21:10.600 --> 21:12.370
The Demon Defense Force...

21:14.220 --> 21:17.380
I think it's time to do
our god's declaration.

21:18.460 --> 21:22.090
Humans, we've descended.

21:22.960 --> 21:24.600
What do you think?

21:25.000 --> 21:26.900
It doesn't seem very dignified.

21:26.900 --> 21:27.780
Huh?

21:30.040 --> 21:32.720
I'll make it look divine there.

21:33.100 --> 21:34.960
Sounds good.

21:35.260 --> 21:37.640
Alright, let's go.

21:41.070 --> 21:44.570
Hey, why don't you try to relax?

21:44.570 --> 21:49.700
If we hold each other hands,
we'll be invincible

21:49.700 --> 21:54.410
Our hands are linked together
in the chain that holding you

21:54.410 --> 21:56.660
I'll never let you go

22:12.280 --> 22:16.180
Effort alone is not enough

22:16.280 --> 22:20.060
Sometimes things just happen
out of the blue

22:20.200 --> 22:22.360
But it's easy to change

22:22.360 --> 22:28.240
A special relationship starts
from the encounter with you

22:28.240 --> 22:36.200
These shaking feelings and body heat
are anxiety which comes from you

22:36.200 --> 22:43.130
My heart beats faster
with each twist or two

22:43.130 --> 22:46.590
Hey, why don't you try to relax?

22:46.590 --> 22:51.700
If we hold each other hands,
we'll be invincible

22:51.700 --> 22:57.100
Our hands are linked together
transmitting sympathy

22:57.100 --> 22:59.270
In the chain that holding you

22:59.270 --> 23:03.700
I'll never let you go again

23:03.700 --> 23:06.980
I'll never let you go

23:11.580 --> 23:12.790
Infiltration success!

23:12.790 --> 23:14.830
My ability made us able
to infiltrate beautifully.

23:14.830 --> 23:16.000
Please teach us!
With Senior Coco and...

23:16.000 --> 23:17.300
The beautiful Senior Naon.

23:17.300 --> 23:19.500
Today, we're going to teach you
about our peach's blessings.

23:19.500 --> 23:22.250
My Coco Juice is the ability
to freely manipulate bodily fluids.

23:22.250 --> 23:24.930
I can make my body slippery
and make attacks slip away.

23:24.930 --> 23:26.890
But, your weakness is
slashing attacks, so be careful.

23:26.890 --> 23:29.080
My Hitori Shizuka can make me
hide and pass through objects.

23:29.080 --> 23:32.890
I can move this beautiful body freely
through walls and the ground.

23:32.890 --> 23:35.180
But she's not good at doing it
in moving things.

23:35.180 --> 23:37.030
(Top Secret)
Oh no! We've been discovered!

23:37.030 --> 23:38.920
Next episode,
Struggle, Aoba Becomes Excited.

23:38.920 --> 23:40.820
You better remember this,
Demon Defense Force!
